        <div id="ContentPlaceHolder1_main" class="period-main">
            <h3 class="period-title">
                高雄市議會第一屆
            </h3>
            <span class="data">
                民國 99 年 12 月 25 日至民國 103 年 12 月 24 日
            </span>
            <div class="period-content">
                <div id="ContentPlaceHolder1_Caption" class="period-block">
                    <h4 class="period-subtitle">說明</h4>

                    <div class="p">
                        <p>
                            一、	依據「地方制度法」第三十三條規定各選區應選議員名額達４名者，應有婦女當選名額１名。<br>二、	本屆女性議員２５名。<br>三、	本屆議員８人因故解職、１人轉任立委及１人病逝。
                    </div>
                </div>

                

                <div class="period-block">
                    <h4 class="period-subtitle">議員人數
                        <span>
                            66
                        </span>
                        人
                    </h4>

                    <div id="memberinfo" class="p">
                        <p>
                            議 長：
                            <a href="#h1756" title="許崑源">許崑源</a>
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            副議長：
                            <a href="#h1796" title="蔡昌達">蔡昌達</a>
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            秘書長：<a href="#h2132" title="徐隆盛">徐隆盛</a>、<a href="#h2141" title="吳修養">吳修養</a>
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            議員：<br/>
                            <a href="#h1669" title="朱信強">朱信強(解職)</a>、<a href="#h1671" title="李鴻鈞">李鴻鈞(解職)</a>、<a href="#h1667" title="林富寶">林富寶</a>、<a href="#h1675" title="林義迪">林義迪</a>、<a href="#h1673" title="鍾盛有">鍾盛有</a>、<a href="#h1677" title="李長生">李長生</a>、<a href="#h1679" title="張文瑞">張文瑞</a>、<a href="#h1681" title="陳明澤">陳明澤</a>、<a href="#h1683" title="蘇琦莉">蘇琦莉</a>、<a href="#h1697" title="方信淵">方信淵</a>、<a href="#h1695" title="李蕙蕙">李蕙蕙(解職)</a>、<a href="#h1689" title="翁瑞珠">翁瑞珠</a>、<a href="#h1687" title="許福森">許福森</a>、<a href="#h1685" title="陳政聞">陳政聞</a>、<a href="#h1691" title="陸淑美">陸淑美</a>、<a href="#h1693" title="曾水文">曾水文(解職)</a>、<a href="#h1709" title="李眉蓁">李眉蓁</a>、<a href="#h1713" title="周鍾㴴">周鍾㴴</a>、<a href="#h1701" title="林瑩蓉">林瑩蓉</a>、<a href="#h1703" title="張豐藤">張豐藤</a>、<a href="#h1705" title="陳玫娟">陳玫娟</a>、<a href="#h1699" title="陳麗珍">陳麗珍</a>、<a href="#h1707" title="黃石龍">黃石龍</a>、<a href="#h1711" title="藍星木">藍星木</a>、<a href="#h1719" title="吳利成">吳利成</a>、<a href="#h1715" title="林芳如">林芳如</a>、<a href="#h1721" title="張勝富">張勝富(解職)</a>、<a href="#h1722" title="許慧玉">許慧玉</a>、<a href="#h1717" title="錢聖武">錢聖武(病逝)</a>、<a href="#h1724" title="李喬如">李喬如</a>、<a href="#h1726" title="連立堅">連立堅</a>、<a href="#h1730" title="陳美雅">陳美雅</a>、<a href="#h1728" title="蔡金晏">蔡金晏</a>、<a href="#h1746" title="林武忠">林武忠</a>、<a href="#h1740" title="洪平朗">洪平朗</a>、<a href="#h1736" title="康裕成">康裕成</a>、<a href="#h1744" title="曾俊傑">曾俊傑</a>、<a href="#h1742" title="童燕珍">童燕珍</a>、<a href="#h1732" title="黃柏霖">黃柏霖</a>、<a href="#h1734" title="黃淑美">黃淑美</a>、<a href="#h1738" title="鄭新助">鄭新助</a>、<a href="#h1758" title="吳益政">吳益政</a>、<a href="#h1750" title="周玲妏">周玲妏</a>、<a href="#h1752" title="莊啟旺">莊啟旺</a>、<a href="#h1748" title="郭建盟">郭建盟</a>、<a href="#h1754" title="蕭永達">蕭永達</a>、<a href="#h1768" title="李雅靜">李雅靜</a>、<a href="#h1776" title="徐榮延">徐榮延</a>、<a href="#h1764" title="張漢忠">張漢忠</a>、<a href="#h1772" title="陳粹鑾">陳粹鑾</a>、<a href="#h1762" title="陳慧文">陳慧文</a>、<a href="#h1770" title="楊見福">楊見福(解職)</a>、<a href="#h1766" title="劉德林">劉德林</a>、<a href="#h1760" title="顏曉菁">顏曉菁</a>、<a href="#h1774" title="蘇炎城">蘇炎城</a>、<a href="#h1782" title="李順進">李順進</a>、<a href="#h1786" title="林宛蓉">林宛蓉</a>、<a href="#h1778" title="林國正">林國正(轉任立委)</a>、<a href="#h1790" title="陳信瑜">陳信瑜</a>、<a href="#h1792" title="陳致中">陳致中(解職)</a>、<a href="#h1788" title="陳麗娜">陳麗娜</a>、<a href="#h1780" title="曾麗燕">曾麗燕</a>、<a href="#h1784" title="鄭光峰">鄭光峰</a>、<a href="#h1800" title="洪秀錦">洪秀錦</a>、<a href="#h1798" title="黃天煌">黃天煌</a>、<a href="#h1794" title="韓賜村">韓賜村</a>、<a href="#h1802" title="俄鄧‧殷艾(Eteng‧Ingay)">俄鄧‧殷艾(Eteng‧Ingay)</a>、<a href="#h1804" title="柯路加(Istanba Ciban)">柯路加(Istanba Ciban)</a>、<a href="#h1806" title="伊斯坦大‧貝雅夫‧正福(Istanda．Paingav)">伊斯坦大‧貝雅夫‧正福(Istanda．Paingav)</a>、<a href="#h1810" title="唐惠美">唐惠美</a>、<a href="#h1808" title="孫慶龍">孫慶龍(辭職)</a>
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div id="ContentPlaceHolder1_main3" class="period-main" style="display: none">
                            <div class="period-Intro" id="h1756">
            <img alt="許崑源" src="https://ws.kcc.gov.tw/001/Upload/member/1756/0701041.jpg">
            <div class="text">
            <h3>許崑源</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li style="max-width:220px"><span>合併前高雄市議會</span>
                        <ol>
                        <li><span>第四屆83~87</span></li>
                        <li><span>第五屆87~91</span></li>
                        <li><span>第六屆91~95</span></li>
                        <li><span>第七屆95~99</span></li>
                        </ol>
                    </li>
                    <li style="max-width:220px"><span>高雄市議會</span>
                        <ol>
                        <li><span>第一屆99~103</span></li>
                        </ol>
                    </li>
                </div>
